Although Midranda's great generals were defeated in the battle of the Invasion of Pillai, his troops were made of powerful creatures that served as Midranda's personal guard.
These troops are also trapped on the Shadow Road. We cannot let them cross the portal and bring chaos.

Help the Royal Mages stop these creatures. Your attack power will be lowered by 30% so you do not alert the monsters.

[Challenge Objective]

Hunt 100 monsters on the Shadow Road, among them the Crios, the Najan or the Ignis.
When you are done, talk to the Royal Mage on the Road to the Wind.
